# Vanta G4a (0004): WebGL identity from the persona's device record.
# UNMASKED_VENDOR/RENDERER_WEBGL = persona gpu.vendor/renderer. For an ANGLE
# Direct3D 11 (vs_5_0) persona, the getParameter limits ANGLE's D3D11 backend
# fixes from the feature level (renderer11_utils.cpp), the vendor-dependent
# MAX_VERTEX_UNIFORM_VECTORS (4095 NVIDIA / 4096 else, plus the WebGL 2
# component counts), shader precisions, and no ASTC/ETC/ETC1/PVRTC extensions.
# Adds the Blink-side persona adapter platform/vanta/vanta_persona.{h,cc}
# (the only file that reads components/vanta). No persona: unchanged Chromium.

